    "body": "The aim-tolerance repair is installed. AimToleranceScreenRadius now hot-reloads every two seconds and accepts the full normalized-screen geometric range up to 0.7071 instead of silently clamping 1 to 0.15 at startup. Test clearly different small and large values on both peds and plants; the log now records the nearest measured screen distance and whether the configured radius accepted or rejected it.",
